  -api-base-url string
    	required: the api's own external origin, e.g. https://api.weft.example.com (ingest URLs shown to users)
  -base-url string
    	required: the web app's external origin, e.g. https://weft.example.com (magic links, CORS)
  -coordinator string
    	coordinator gRPC address (its --local-addr; the public port serves only ingest RPCs) (default "localhost:9025")
  -db-dsn string
    	PostgreSQL DSN
  -port string
    	HTTP listen port (default "8080")
  -redis-addr string
    	Redis/Valkey address for the shared ingest-schema cache (host:port); empty disables it, every schema lookup falls through to Postgres directly
  -redis-tls
    	use TLS for the Redis connection (required for ElastiCache in-transit encryption)
  -render-syslog-port int
    	TCP port for the Render TLS syslog listener; the NLB terminates TLS and forwards plaintext here (default 9023)
  -tls-ca string
    	PEM CA bundle: dial peers over TLS, trusting it; empty dials plaintext
  -tls-cert string
    	PEM certificate to serve TLS with (with --tls-key); empty serves plaintext
  -tls-key string
    	PEM private key for --tls-cert
